Figure 3 consists of four subplots (a-d) showing ARank values across layers for different models. (a) Show-o: ARank values range from 400 to 600, with the Generation Task generally higher than the Understanding Task. (b) JanusFlow: ARank values range from 300 to 550, with the Generation Task generally higher. (c) Emu3: ARank values range from 1000 to 2500, with the Generation Task generally higher. (d) Lumina-mgnt: ARank values range from 600 to 1000, with both tasks showing similar patterns.

